# The probe's test bench: the office and a machine of targets.
#
#   shop 10.50.0.0/24:  office .20 ---- targets .10 (the shop's name server and web server)
#   10.99.0.0/24 is routed to targets, which doesn't forward it: a range that answers nothing.
machine office
machine targets

lan shop office:eth0=10.50.0.20/24 targets:eth0=10.50.0.10/24

route office 10.99.0.0/24 via 10.50.0.10
dns office 10.50.0.10

run targets unbound nginx
